	3.2 Example (delete after reading)
Feature: Student Login
Req. ID
	Requirement Statement
	Priority
	Acceptance Criteria
	FR-01
	The system shall authenticate a student using a registered email and password.
	High
	Valid credentials open the dashboard within 3 seconds.
	FR-02
	The system shall lock an account for 15 minutes after 5 consecutive failed login attempts.
	Medium
	The sixth attempt within 15 minutes is rejected with a lock message.
	FR-03
	The system shall allow password reset via an emailed one-time link.
	High
	The link expires after 30 minutes and works only once.
