5. Non-Functional Requirements
Guidance: Make each requirement measurable. Avoid vague words such as "fast", "user-friendly" or "secure" without a metric.
5.1 Performance Requirements
ID
	Requirement
	Measure
	NFR-01
	Pages shall load within [3] seconds under normal load.
	Response time ≤ 3 s
